  m_Name: PokedexCow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryId: cow
  commonName: Domestic Cow
  scientificName: Bos taurus
  icon: {fileID: 10904, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  category: Mammal
  habitat: Pastures & Open Fields
  height: 1.3 - 1.5 m
  weight: 500 - 800 kg
  diet: Herbivore
  rarity: Common
  shortDescription: A massive, placid ruminant mammal integrated widely into agricultural
    grazing landscapes around the globe.
  behaviorNotes: Extremely calm and methodical. They spend upwards of eight hours
    a day chewing their cud while resting peacefully in groups under open skies.
  observationTips: Very prominent landmarks due to their blocky shape. Look for them
    dotting wide pastures or gathered under shade trees.
  funFact: Cows do not have any top front teeth! Instead, they press their sharp
    bottom teeth against a thick, tough layer of tissue called a dental pad to tear
    grass.
  facts:
  - 'As complex ruminants, they possess a specialized four-compartment stomach designed
    to ferment and break down tough cellulose fibers found in wild grass. '
  - 'Cows are highly social and form deep, long-lasting friendships within their
    herds, showing measurable spikes in stress when separated from their favorite
    companions. '
  - They have an acute sense of hearing and can detect high and low frequencies far
    beyond human capability, helping them track distant environmental threats.
